{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":17.6},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.8,"end":34.88},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.08,"end":46.8}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.6,"text":"成果是附帶明確假設的模型情境比較。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.16,"end":7.52,"text":"記錄初始族群、容量與成長率，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.88,"end":11.28,"text":"再指出一項機制和一個省略因素，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.76,"end":14.4,"text":"例如遷徙或季節資源。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.04,"end":17.6,"text":"不要把平滑曲線當成預報。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.8,"end":22.48,"text":"改變一項輸入前先匯出基準作品資料，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.8,"end":25.2,"text":"再另外匯出比較情境。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.84,"end":28.12,"text":"說明若加入遷徙，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.16,"end":31.28,"text":"可能如何改變對下降族群的結論。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":32.8,"end":34.88,"text":"哪個說法適合放進報告？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":36.08,"end":38.16,"text":"哪個說法適合放進報告？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.6,"end":43.52,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44,"end":46.8,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}